OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy morning with
OL,6,Fsome showers, these most frequent over
OL,7,Fnortheastern areas and occasionally
OL,8,Fturning wintry. More by way of dry and
OL,9,Fbright spells developing through the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Feeling chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear spells
OL,13,Fat first allowing for an early frost.
OL,14,FTurning cloudier through the evening
OL,15,Fand overnight with a few showers from
OL,16,Fthe east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
