OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRather cloudy throughout the
OL,6,Fday with some showers in the morning,
OL,7,Fturning to more persistent rain and
OL,8,Fhill snow through the day. Breezy
OL,9,Faround the coast with fresh easterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FWednesday starts rather cloudy with
OL,14,Fsome patchy rain, dry and bright
OL,15,Fspells developing before some showers
OL,16,Flater. Thursday and Friday will be
OL,17,Fchilly with bright spells and a few
OL,18,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
